@@ -4,9 +4,18 @@ A small team notes app. Next.js App Router + TypeScript + Tailwind.
 
 ## Status
 
-- Users live in `src/lib/users.ts` as an in-memory list.
-- `/dashboard` shows the current user and the team.
-- There is no sign-in, no billing, and no email yet.
+- Authentication and user management run on [Clerk](https://clerk.com) (`@clerk/nextjs`) — no local user store.
+- Sign-in supports Google, email + password, and email magic links.
+- `/dashboard` shows the current user and the team (fetched live from Clerk).
+- `/account` (Clerk's `<UserProfile />`) lets a user change their password, delete their
+  account, and sign out of every device.
+- `/dashboard` and `/account` are protected via `auth.protect()` in each page.
+
+## Configure Clerk
+
+1. Create an app at [dashboard.clerk.com](https://dashboard.clerk.com) and copy `.env.example` to `.env.local`, filling in the real publishable/secret keys.
+2. Under **User & authentication**, enable **Password** and **Email verification link** (magic link) as sign-in options, alongside the existing Google social connection.
+3. Under user profile / account settings, enable **Allow users to delete their own account** so the `/account` page can offer account deletion.
 
 ## Develop
 
